<Document>
  <name>Stone Tool Manufacturing Techniques over 3 Million Years</name>
  <description><![CDATA[Archaeological assemblages, primate tool use and flintknapping experiments coded for 33 stone-tool-making procedural units (techniques).<br/><br/><b>Source:</b> Paige, J. and Perreault, C. 2023. <i>A Dataset Describing the Manufacturing of Stone Tools Over 3 Million Years</i>. Journal of Open Archaeology Data 11(12): 1-7. <a href="https://doi.org/10.5334/joad.114">10.5334/joad.114</a><br/><b>License:</b> CC BY 4.0<br/><br/><b>Note:</b> site coordinates in this release are approximate. Country labels were derived from those coordinates and are not part of the published dataset.]]></description>
  <open>1</open>
