    <Folder><name>Armenia (2)</name><open>0</open>
    <Placemark>
      <name>Nor Geghi 1</name>
      <styleUrl>#arch</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<div style="font:13px/1.45 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:400px"><table><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Site</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Nor Geghi 1</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Country</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Armenia</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Entry type</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Archaeological</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Species attribution</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Unattributed</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Technology (interpreted)</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Other</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Age</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">435 - 304 ka</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Basis for date</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">-</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Scope of entry</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Single sequence</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Technology described</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Preferential levallois points made on cores on flakes. Debord is described as present but in my classification these are lateral trimming flakes. Flakes are facetted. The assembalge is heavily patinated and worn so less clear about association between pref levall and retouch. Scrapers are common though/</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Published source</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Adler et al. 2014</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Techniques recorded</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">10 of 33</td></tr></table><p style="margin:10px 0 3px"><b>Procedural units present</b></p><p style="margin:0">Platform faceting, Centripetal shaping, Lateral shaping, Trimming platform overhang, Hard hammer percussion, Support core with hand, Core rotation, Invasive flaking, Retouch, Backing</p></div>]]></description>
