3px"><b>Procedural units present</b></p><p style="margin:0">Platform faceting, Cresting, Debordante shaping, Overshot flaking, Hard hammer percussion, Support core with hand, Core rotation, Invasive flaking, Retouch, Backing, Burination</p></div>]]></description>
