      <name>NY 18 Nyabusosi</name>
      <styleUrl>#arch</styleUrl>
      <description><![CDATA[<div style="font:13px/1.45 Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:400px"><table><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Site</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">NY 18 Nyabusosi</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Country</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Uganda</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Entry type</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Archaeological</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Species attribution</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Unattributed</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Technology (interpreted)</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Oldowan</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Age</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">2,000 - 1,500 ka</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Basis for date</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">-</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Scope of entry</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Single sequence</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Technology described</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Oldowan flake production on prepared radial cores with some evidence for debordante removals. While retouch is described in the paper it isn't clear if the prepared core flakes were retouched.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Published source</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">Texier 1995</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 10px 2px 0;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap"><b>Techniques recorded</b></td><td style="padding:2px 0">7 of 33</td></tr></table><p style="margin:10px 0 3px"><b>Procedural units present</b></p><p style="margin:0">Platform faceting, Centripetal shaping, Debordante shaping, Hard hammer percussion, Support core with hand, Core rotation, Invasive flaking</p></div>]]></description>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Source"><value>Texier 1995</value></Data>
        <Data name="Species"><value>Unattributed</value></Data>
        <Data name="Technology"><value>Oldowan</value></Data>
